      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: could be a bit cleaner...\n\n kconfig_files \u003d [here / \"prj.conf\"]\n if project_name.startswith(\"adlrvp\"):\n     kconfig_files.append(here / \"prj_adlrvp.conf\")\n kconfig_files.extend(extra_kconfig_files)\n \nAlso note that generally as a pattern we try and keep all the .conf files in the same directory now to make it harder to copy/paste an entire directory to setup new projects.",
      "range": {
